      <h1 class="text-center mt-3">TERMS AND CONDITIONS</h1>
      <p class="text-center">(Last Amended 10th Sep 2024)</p>
      <p>This agreement which constitutes the Astrologers Terms and Conditions, is a legal agreement ("Agreement") between Astrologer ("You") and IIAG Jyotish Sansthan in connection with access and/or use the platform for providing on-line advice/services at all websites powered by AstroIIAG, or owned by IIAG Jyotish Sansthan. The Sites are currently owned and operated by AstroIIAG ("IIAG Jyotish Sansthan"). This Agreement sets forth and contains the terms and conditions between you i.e. the Astrologer and IIAG Jyotish Sansthan. By using any portion of the website or app you agree to be bound by this Agreement. It is advisable that you should read this Agreement carefully. In the event, if you do not agree to be bound by any clause of this agreement, you should immediately cease from using any portion of the website. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan solely reserves the right to modify this Agreement any time to comply with law or provision of service or for any other reason solely at the discretion of IIAG Jyotish Sansthan, which may or may not be separately notiﬁed via email. You can determine when these Terms were last revised by referring to 'Last Amended' at the top of these Terms. By signing onto the portal or using any portion of the portal/web/app any time after the "Last Amended" date, you shall be deemed to have accepted the Terms herein including the amended Terms published from time to time. Your continued use of the Platform following the posting of changes mean that you accept and agree to the changes. However, you are encouraged to check the terms of this Agreement frequently. While you continue to use this Platform, any modiﬁcations have been made to this Agreement, would certainly indicate your consent to such modiﬁed agreement. By accessing this portal, you agree to read and accept this agreement provided to you in electronic form.</p>
      <h5>1.0 IMPORTANT DEFINITIONS</h5>
      <h6>1.1 ASTROLOGER</h6>
      <p>You are an "Astrologer" if you are selected/appointed/registered as Astrologer with the explicit purpose of providing your consultation to the visitors/users of the IIAG Jyotish Sansthan Platform and/or on partner Sites. Your Astrologer Registration/application Form is subject to approval of IIAG Jyotish Sansthan, once the same is accepted, your proﬁle will be activated by IIAG Jyotish Sansthan. Rejection of a proﬁle may occur due to incomplete forms/information, or due to lack of experience or incompetency or any other reason that may not have been speciﬁcally mentioned here. Any information found incorrect, misleading at any time/duration, your proﬁle, at our sole discretion, shall be subject to rejection without any notice period and IIAG Jyotish Sansthan may take legal action for such misleading facts.</p>
      <h6>1.2 MEMBER OR USER OR CUSTOMER</h6>
      <p>A member or user or customer is one who has registered themselves or applied for availing services on the IIAG Jyotish Sansthan platform for advice or services from an Astrologer. A user may or may not be a paid member. Users can register to avail of free consultation.</p>
      <h6>1.3 WEBSITE OR PORTAL OR PLATFORM</h6>
      <p>Website or portal or platform means all websites/apps owned by IIAG Jyotish Santhan including IIAG.CO.IN. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan provides various astrology services including "Ask A Question"service. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan also provides a platform wherein Astrologer and Users meet for Astrology services. IIAG.CO.IN is one of such platform.</p>
      <h6>1.4 SERVICE</h6>
      <p>Service includes "Ask A Question" service, phone/call/chat advice service provided through various platforms of IIAG Jyotish Sansthan. In IIAG Jyotish Sansthan platform, a user registers himself for availing paid or free advice from registered/appointed Astrologers. This Platform allows users to select an Astrologer from various Astrologers registered therein and ask questions online through chat, voice call or video call service. This platform connects the Astrologer and User.</p>
      <h6>2.0 DUTIES TOWARD USER/MEMBER/CUSTOMER</h6>
      <p>2.1: You will provide true and accurate information Astrology qualiﬁcations, expertise, skills, degrees, background and will maintain and update all such information during the term of this Agreement to keep it true. You will not present misleading names/qualiﬁcations.</p>
      <p>2.2: You will not perform/o er services/advice in any jurisdiction where you are not authorized or qualiﬁed or licensed or which is outside your expertise. You will not mislead Users to believe that you can provide such services which are outside your expertise or for which you are not licensed.</p>
      <p>2.3: You will not advise any remedy, treatment, test, that requires an in-person physical examination of a User.</p>
      <p>2.4: You will advise users that your advice can not be a substitute for the advice of a physician and that your advice is for informational purposes only and it cannot be substitute for it.</p>
      <p>2.5: You will not provide any advice related to any matters like medical or legal which can be provided by only a qualiﬁed medical or legal expert.</p>
      <p>2.6: You will not take any actions which may hamper, slow down, or manipulate the integrity of this portal/Site.</p>
      <p>2.7: You will not transmit/communicate through the Site/portal any unlawful, bullying, defamatory, privacy violative, insulting, intimidating, derogatory, vulgar, indecent, racist, destructive or otherwise o ensive/objectionable material of any kind.</p>
      <p>2.8: You will not stalk, intimidate or harass any Astrologer or User or infringe upon or attempt to violate upon their privacy.</p>
      <p>2.9: You will not violate any applicable local, national, or international law of any kind.</p>
      <p>2.10 You will not attempt to contact the User for any sort of payment or fee.</p>
      <p>2.11: You will not exchange any personal contact information with any User for any purpose, which may include making o line payment or in-personal meetings.</p>
      <p>2.12: You will not attempt to take the act for providing o line/online advice with any user provided by this portal other than use of this portal.</p>
      <p>2.13: You will not attempt to fraudulently increase talk/chat time with User which would result in a greater payment to you.</p>
      <p>2.14: You will be agreed to all performance ratings and reviews given by the User after availing services from you. And agree to display such ratings/reviews on IIAG Jyotish Sansthan Platform to the public. You also understand that IIAG Jyotish Sansthan has nothing to do with such ratings/reviews. If Astrologer ﬁnds any review harsh, o ensive, objectionable it may bring it to IIAG Jyotish Sansthan knowledge for moderation.</p>
      <p>2.15: You will not advise on matters/games related to gambling.</p>
      <h6>3.0: ADDITIONAL TERM & CONDITIONS FOR 'ASK A QUESTION' SERVICE</h6>
      <p>All Terms & Conditions given in this agreement apply to Astrologer while answering or registering for providing "Ask A Question" Service. Below are additional Term & Conditions while answering "Ask A Question" Service</p>
