      <p>4.10: You understand that IIAG Jyotish Sansthan promotes the Astrologers proﬁles through various digital and social media platforms. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan shall have the right to use Astrologer proﬁle picture, video, content, ratings, reviews and description for promotional and advertising purposes. Additionally, any pictures and videos of the astrologer provided by the astrologer or captured by IIAG Jyotish Sansthan, either directly or during live sessions, may also be used for promoting and advertising IIAG Jyotish Sansthan services & Products.</p>
      <p>4.11: You understand that all chats, phone calls and video consultations with customers of the Website will be recorded for quality assurance purposes. With prior agreement from You, IIAG Jyotish Sansthan reserves the right to observe such conversations and consultations for monitoring purposes.</p>
      <p>4.12: The astrologer hereby undertakes not to upload, publish, email, send, or in any way disseminate any content on or through IIAG Jyotish Sansthan that is illegal, detrimental, menacing, abusive, harassing, tortious, slanderous, indecent, obscene, defamatory, invasive of someone else's privacy, hateful, or that exhibits racial, ethnic, or any other form of objectionable characteristics.</p>
