      <p>7.5: All payments to be made to Astrologers are after deduction of TDS as per Income Tax Act. 1961. Astrologer agrees that TDS will be deducted from any payment made to astrologer irrespective of amount or monetary limit. Payments are to be made within 10 days of the following month in which revenue has accrued subject to public holidays or conditions beyond the control of IIAG Jyotish Sansthan. In the ﬁrst month in which the Astrologer is onboarded, payments may be delayed due to documentation.</p>
      <p>7.6: IIAG Jyotish Sansthan's billing system is not error-free, and shall not be liable for any problems, miscalculations or malfunctions in processing Astrologer Fees or other payments due to the Astrologer. Astrologers can inform of such mistakes within 48hours of discovery of such mistakes.</p>
