      <p>7.8: Any Astrologer advice that is disputed, and remains unresolved, will be withheld for a reasonable amount of time till the problem is resolved. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan will have the ﬁnal say with regards to disputes in this regard.</p>
      <p>7.9: Astrologer agree and declare that if the customer is not satisﬁed with the services provided by you inclusive of wrong predictions being made or the service could not be rendered due to internet issue or other reasons, the IIAG Jyotish Sansthan may at its own discretion, refund all or partial amount to the customer, for which no payment is to be made to the Astrologer.</p>
