      <p>8.3: IIAG Jyotish Sansthan encourages Astrologers to change their password at least once a month. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan will not be liable for any loss that you incur as a result of someone else using your account or your password, either with or without your knowledge. You may be held liable for any losses incurred by IIAG Jyotish Sansthan due to someone else's use of your account or password.</p>
