      <h6>14.0 TERMINATION</h6>
      <p>14.1: IIAG Jyotish Sansthan at its sole discretion may terminate this agreement without giving any reason with immediate e ect by giving you a written notice to your registered mail id and remove your proﬁle from the App/Web.</p>
      <p>14.2: During the ﬁrst three months of employment, referred to as the "Induction Phase," the astrologer is not permitted to tender their resignation. This policy is implemented to allow the Company to recoup its investment in the astrologer's hiring and skill development. If the astrologer chooses to terminate their employment within this Induction Phase, they will incur a ﬁnancial penalty of INR 100,000. This sum is intended to o set the Company's expenditures related to hiring, orientation, training, and associated administrative costs incurred during the astrologer's brief tenure. After the Probation Period, if an astrologer wishes to resign, they must provide a written notice of at least 30 days prior to their intention to terminate the Agreement. During this notice period, the Astrologer shall be obligated to render the Services they have been engaged to render under this Agreement at the same level of service conditions as stipulated in this Agreement and shall not deteriorate the level of service quality in any manner. The Astrologer must complete 90 login hours during the 30-day notice period, shall not knowingly avoid any chat/call/video call, and cannot work for or join any other astrology platform. The Astrologer will mandatorily be required to serve the notice period, unless waived by the Company at its sole discretion. If the Astrologer fails to serve the full notice period, they shall be liable to pay a penalty of INR 51,000. Additionally, the Astrologer's whole earning will be forfeited on violation of any part of this clause, including but not limited to deterioration of service quality, failure to complete required login hours, avoiding chats/calls/video calls, or working for another astrology platform during the notice period. The whole earning will be forfeited even if partial notice days/login time is served.</p>
      <p>14.3: No payment will be made to an astrologer serving his notice period till the full and ﬁnal settlement. Full and ﬁnal settlement includes completion of 30 days' notice period and completion of all other formalities of termination as mentioned in clause 14.2. Any payment due to such astrologer till full and final settlement will remain on hold.</p>
      <p>14.4: You agree that even after termination of this agreement, or during the term of this agreement, you will not contact any IIAG Jyotish Sansthan customers, whether or not you had earlier consulted with them during the term of this agreement. IIAG Jyotish Sansthan may take legal action for any violation of this clause. </p>
      <p>14.5: You understand that IIAG Jyotish Sansthan uses its astrologer name, pics, video and other information for promotional purposes, and such information will get published in multiple pages of IIAG Jyotish Sansthan web/app, it is not practical to remove the videos/pictures from all locations and it may display even after the end of term of this agreement. </p>
      <h6>15.0 FINE AND PENALTY</h6>
      <p>15.1: You will provide true and accurate information related to your qualifications, expertise, skills, degrees, background, photograph and will maintain and update all such information during the term of this Agreement to keep it true. You will not present misleading names/qualifications/photographs/Videos. Any information found to be misleading, illegal or wrong, a penalty of Rs. 11,000/- shall be imposed and your profile shall be deactivated immediately without informing you. </p>
      <p>15.2: You should treat the customer who contacts you through IIAG Jyotish Sansthan with respect. Any use of filthy language, threats, or similar behavior will result in the cancellation of your IIAG Jyotish Sansthan profile for a minimum of seven (7) days and a penalty of Rs. 11000/- to reactivate your profile. The parties have also agreed that the 7-days period might be prolonged till the penalty is paid. You also agree that it is the discretion of the IIAG Jyotish Sansthan compliance team to decide what is disrespectful to the customer after giving Astrologer equal opportunity of being heard. You must maintain proper decorum and answer all of the customer's queries in a calm manner. You undertake not to upload the customer's personal information or display the reason or purpose for seeking counsel from you anywhere on the internet or any other platform. Any complaint received in this situation will result in your profile being deactivated without warning.</p>
