      <p>15.4: You must not share any personal information about yourself, your friends, acquaintances, family members, or anybody else with whom you may or may not be associated. Contact numbers, bank account numbers, e-mail addresses, websites, personalized pages, blogs, and social media profiles [including but not limited to Facebook, WeChat, WhatsApp, Telegram, Messenger, SMS, and others] with any consumer seeking help are all examples of personal information. You also do not induce customers for oƯline meetings. A customer should also not share any such personal information and if the customer does it so, it is your responsibly to report such matter to the company immediately and not to contact customer. A penalty of Rs. 11,000/- INR will be imposed if this condition is violated and the account will be temporarily deactivated. Furthermore, IIAG Jyotish Sansthan verified Badge shall be removed on violation from your profile.</p>
      <p>15.5: It is suggested that you oƯer the customer seeking help easier solutions. Any advice directly related to any loss or danger of life, whether animal or human, would be considered a gross violation of the terms and conditions. A penalty of Rs. 1,00,000/- would be imposed for any infringement of this condition and the account will be temporarily deactivated. Furthermore, IIAG Jyotish Sansthan verified Badge shall be removed on violation from your profile.</p>
      <p>15.6: You agree not to do anything that could harm IIAG Jyotish Sansthan's reputation or interests, such as posting negative reviews on any social media platform, disclosing the company's policies to anyone, or making any defamatory comments of any kind or nature about the Company, its employees, oƯicers, directors, agents, consultants, aƯiliates, and so on. You should also not indulge in any such act, like giving negative comments/reviews, which negatively impact other astrologers working in this platform. You also agree that you will not encourage, motivate, or convince any of your friends, family members, clients, acquaintances, or anyone else to do the same. A penalty of Rs. 11,000/- INR would be imposed for any infringement of this condition. Furthermore, IIAG Jyotish Sansthan verified Badge shall be removed on violation from your profile.</p>
      <p>15.7: By registering with IIAG Jyotish Sansthan, you promise not to work or deliver your services on any competing platform that provides identical services via the internet. You may not use a fictitious or alias name while attempting to provide services (similar to those provided at IIAG Jyotish Sansthan) on any competitor platform via the internet. Violation of this clause will attract the deactivation of your profile without any warning issued. A fine of Rs. 11,000 may be imposed by the compliance team at IIAG Jyotish Sansthan and all your earning will be forfeited.</p>
      <p>15.8: The compliance team shall review each of the violations mentioned in clause 15, on being found guilty, the penalties mentioned therein shall be charged. To re-activate the IIAG Jyotish Sansthan verified Badge Rs. 11,000/- shall be charged from the Astrologers. To recover the penalty earning may be forfeited. </p>
