      <p>17.4: You agree not to do anything that could harm IIAG Jyotish Sansthan's reputation or interests, such as posting negative reviews on any social media platform, disclosing the company's policies to anyone, or making any defamatory comments of any kind or nature about the Company, its employees, oƯicers, directors, agents, consultants, aƯiliates, and so on. A penalty of Rs. 11,000/- INR will be imposed if this condition is violated and the account will be temporarily deactivated. Furthermore, IIAG Jyotish Sansthan verified Badge shall be removed on violation from your profile.</p>
      <p>17.5: You are not allowed to promote or encourage any other astrology application or any astrologer working outside IIAG Jyotish Sansthan on the live streaming platform. A penalty of Rs. 11,000/- INR will be imposed if this condition is violated and the account will be temporarily deactivated. Furthermore, IIAG Jyotish Sansthan verified Badge shall be removed on violation from your profile.</p>
